      "slot": "passive",
      "name": "Good Omens",
      "text": "Every 5s, Ming's next Basic Attack deals magical damage and heals himself and the linked teammate. The healing is reduced if the enemy is not a hero."
    },
    {
      "slot": "s1",
      "name": "Time - Carefree",
      "text": "Throws his instrument and links it to a teammate, increasing their main attack stat and Attack Speed. Enemies who touch the link take damage over time. Passive: Increases Ming's Physical Attack, Magical Attack, and Movement Speed."
    },
    {
      "slot": "s2",
      "name": "Mastery - Glide",
      "text": "Throws his instrument and links it to an enemy, reducing their Physical and Magical Defense. Enemies who touch the link take damage over time. Passive: Gains Physical and Magical Defense."
    },
    {
      "slot": "ult",
      "name": "Peace - Longevity",
      "text": "Ming channels for a short time before sacrificing Health to deal true damage to the linked enemy or heal the linked teammate. If linked to both, he does not lose Health."
    }
  ],
